"P3901325553" "I've got bad news for you, {VillainName}. This soul trap you found me? Doesn't work. Not at all. Now, it could be that Ghost Widow managed to slip us a false prototype, or it could be that there's something deeper afoot. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Regardless, I want you to go to the lab where the soul trap technology was first developed.</a> You may be able to find out something there."
// AcceptString :
"P2426496651" "Investigate the lab"
