"P4061633785" "Excellent. This explains why Ghost Widow was unwilling to share her soul trap with the rest of us; the Circle had taken over her lab and taken possession of the working prototype. She must have feared that word of her failure would spread. <br><br>Now, leave me alone with this soul trap, {VillainName}. I have work to do."
